---
title: "4+1 · Process view — a large authorized review"
---
%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif", "fontSize": "14px", "actorBkg": "#D8F1EE", "actorBorder": "#0F766E", "actorTextColor": "#102F35", "noteBkgColor": "#FEF3C7", "noteBorderColor": "#B45309"}, "sequence": {"actorMargin": 42, "boxMargin": 8}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Builder / developer
    participant Sess as Agent session
    participant MCP as proof-mcp
    participant WF as Host Workflow
    participant A as Scoped agents
    Dev->>Sess: /proof:proof-review target --mode all-out
    Note over Sess: Small reviews may stay inline. This example is a large review.
    opt MCP connected
        Sess->>MCP: route_node / estimate_phase
        MCP-->>Sess: source-backed authoring advice
    end
    Sess->>Sess: Author scoped script and estimate
    Sess->>Dev: all-out pre-flight: estimated work / cost / limits
    alt User authorizes the run
        Dev-->>Sess: proceed within stated scope
        Sess->>WF: script + args
        par independent finder dimensions
            WF->>A: find candidates in dimension A
            A-->>WF: source-anchored candidates
        and another dimension
            WF->>A: find candidates in dimension B
            A-->>WF: source-anchored candidates
        end
        Note over WF: Dedup barrier after finder results<br/>Only survivors enter verification
        loop candidate and mode-resolved lenses (stagger same-model bursts)
            WF->>A: try to refute the candidate
            A-->>WF: verdict + actual evidence, or no verdict
        end
        WF-->>Sess: structured result + available journal/usage evidence
        Sess->>Dev: supported findings, scope, checks and unknowns
        Note over Sess,Dev: No supported finding is valid. A dead lens is not a pass.
    else Declined or dry-run
        Sess->>Dev: plan / estimate only<br/>No workflow agents
    end
